sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C as Client
    participant S as Search service
    participant E as Embedding tier
    participant A as ANN index
    participant B as BM25 index
    C->>S: query, k=10, filters
    S->>S: cache lookup keyed by query + filter + model version
    S->>E: embed the query (batched)
    E-->>S: vector
    par run both retrievers together
        S->>A: vector search, k*3, filters applied during traversal
        S->>B: lexical search, k*3
    end
    A-->>S: candidates with distances
    B-->>S: candidates with BM25 scores
    Note over S: the two score scales are not comparable — fuse by rank
    S->>S: reciprocal rank fusion to one top-k
    S-->>C: hits with both component scores, and the mode used
